			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 207040201,
					"content": "(test) 好的姥姥$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207040202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 207040202,
					"content": "(test) 咦？这不是琉璃百合的种子嘛？这不是璃月这边很稀有、很贵重的花$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207040203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 207040203,
					"content": "(test) 姥姥，这还不得挑一个良辰吉日来种么？$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207040204
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 207040204,
					"content": "(test) 这哪是什么名贵的话，最开始，荻花州里可全都是琉璃百合，有很多年轻人会去那里唱歌跳舞$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207040205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萍姥姥"
				},
				{
					"id": 207040205,
					"content": "(test) 只不过在一场战争之后，荻花州被洪水淹没，琉璃百合几乎都被毁了$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207040206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萍姥姥"
				},
				{
					"id": 207040206,
					"content": "(test) 现在，失去了荻花州的琉璃百合，也只能在玉京台里种了。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "萍姥姥"
				}
			]
		},
		{
